    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents the growth characteristics of a species across its instars. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates information about the number of instars, the range of instars, and the conversion ratios to wet mass for each instar. It provides methods to access the last instar, the range of instars, and the conversion coefficients. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
